{"duration": 43.468, "lines": [{"i": 0, "text": "Around the year 1000, Vikings sailed west from Greenland and landed in North America.", "start": 0.25, "end": 4.816, "words": [["Around", 0.25, 0.615], ["the", 0.615, 0.844], ["year", 0.844, 1.118], ["1000,", 1.118, 1.437], ["Vikings", 1.437, 1.848], ["sailed", 1.848, 2.213], ["west", 2.213, 2.487], ["from", 2.487, 2.761], ["Greenland", 2.761, 3.264], ["and", 3.264, 3.492], ["landed", 3.492, 3.857], ["in", 3.857, 4.04], ["North", 4.04, 4.36], ["America.", 4.36, 4.816]]}, {"i": 1, "text": "Almost 500 years before Columbus.", "start": 5.116, "end": 7.162, "words": [["Almost", 5.116, 5.536], ["500", 5.536, 5.798], ["years", 5.798, 6.165], ["before", 6.165, 6.585], ["Columbus.", 6.585, 7.162]]}, {"i": 2, "text": "So why didn't they stay?", "start": 7.612, "end": 8.695, "words": [["So", 7.612, 7.757], ["why", 7.757, 7.937], ["didn't", 7.937, 8.226], ["they", 8.226, 8.443], ["stay?", 8.443, 8.695]]}, {"i": 3, "text": "Problem one: there weren't many of them. All of Norse Greenland was a few thousand people.", "start": 9.295, "end": 14.041, "words": [["Problem", 9.295, 9.694], ["one:", 9.694, 9.961], ["there", 9.961, 10.271], ["weren't", 10.271, 10.67], ["many", 10.67, 10.936], ["of", 10.936, 11.114], ["them.", 11.114, 11.424], ["All", 11.424, 11.646], ["of", 11.646, 11.824], ["Norse", 11.824, 12.134], ["Greenland", 12.134, 12.622], ["was", 12.622, 12.844], ["a", 12.844, 12.977], ["few", 12.977, 13.199], ["thousand", 13.199, 13.642], ["people.", 13.642, 14.041]]}, {"i": 4, "text": "Problem two: the commute. Days, sometimes weeks, of open sea. In an open boat.", "start": 14.441, "end": 20.393, "words": [["Problem", 14.441, 15.017], ["two:", 15.017, 15.401], ["the", 15.401, 15.721], ["commute.", 15.721, 16.361], ["Days,", 16.361, 16.809], ["sometimes", 16.809, 17.513], ["weeks,", 17.513, 18.025], ["of", 18.025, 18.281], ["open", 18.281, 18.665], ["sea.", 18.665, 19.049], ["In", 19.049, 19.305], ["an", 19.305, 19.561], ["open", 19.561, 19.945], ["boat.", 19.945, 20.393]]}, {"i": 5, "text": "Problem three: the neighbours.", "start": 20.843, "end": 22.352, "words": [["Problem", 20.843, 21.231], ["three:", 21.231, 21.576], ["the", 21.576, 21.792], ["neighbours.", 21.792, 22.352]]}, {"i": 6, "text": "The sagas say Leif Erikson's brother, Thorvald, was killed by an arrow on one of the first trips.", "start": 22.702, "end": 27.778, "words": [["The", 22.702, 22.921], ["sagas", 22.921, 23.227], ["say", 23.227, 23.446], ["Leif", 23.446, 23.708], ["Erikson's", 23.708, 24.19], ["brother,", 24.19, 24.627], ["Thorvald,", 24.627, 25.109], ["was", 25.109, 25.328], ["killed", 25.328, 25.678], ["by", 25.678, 25.853], ["an", 25.853, 26.028], ["arrow", 26.028, 26.334], ["on", 26.334, 26.509], ["one", 26.509, 26.728], ["of", 26.728, 26.903], ["the", 26.903, 27.122], ["first", 27.122, 27.428], ["trips.", 27.428, 27.778]]}, {"i": 7, "text": "The locals had more people, more arrows... and home advantage.", "start": 28.128, "end": 31.401, "words": [["The", 28.128, 28.353], ["locals", 28.353, 28.711], ["had", 28.711, 28.935], ["more", 28.935, 29.204], ["people,", 29.204, 29.608], ["more", 29.608, 29.877], ["arrows...", 29.877, 30.37], ["and", 30.37, 30.594], ["home", 30.594, 30.863], ["advantage.", 30.863, 31.401]]}, {"i": 8, "text": "Within a few years, the Norse packed up and sailed home.", "start": 32.001, "end": 34.686, "words": [["Within", 32.001, 32.317], ["a", 32.317, 32.435], ["few", 32.435, 32.633], ["years,", 32.633, 32.949], ["the", 32.949, 33.146], ["Norse", 33.146, 33.422], ["packed", 33.422, 33.738], ["up", 33.738, 33.896], ["and", 33.896, 34.094], ["sailed", 34.094, 34.409], ["home.", 34.409, 34.686]]}, {"i": 9, "text": "They left one camp in Newfoundland. Nobody found it until 1960.", "start": 35.036, "end": 38.929, "words": [["They", 35.036, 35.347], ["left", 35.347, 35.659], ["one", 35.659, 35.918], ["camp", 35.918, 36.23], ["in", 36.23, 36.437], ["Newfoundland.", 36.437, 37.216], ["Nobody", 37.216, 37.631], ["found", 37.631, 37.995], ["it", 37.995, 38.202], ["until", 38.202, 38.566], ["1960.", 38.566, 38.929]]}, {"i": 10, "text": "Turns out, discovering America was the easy part.", "start": 39.529, "end": 42.268, "words": [["Turns", 39.529, 39.86], ["out,", 39.86, 40.143], ["discovering", 40.143, 40.757], ["America", 40.757, 41.182], ["was", 41.182, 41.418], ["the", 41.418, 41.654], ["easy", 41.654, 41.937], ["part.", 41.937, 42.268]]}]}